      "id": "yeats-collected-poems-s0189-p00406",
      "source_en": "Both nuns and mothers worship images,\nBut those the candles light are not as those 50\nThat animate a mother's reveries,\nBut keep a marble or a bronze repose.\n And yet they too break hearts - 0 Presences\nThat passion, piety or affection knows,\nAnd that all heavenly glory symbolise -\n0 self-born mockers of man's enterprise;",
